[
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P1-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P1-S1",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "When it comes to the slowing economy, Ellen Spero isn't biting her nails just yet.",
    "translation": "谈到经济放缓，艾伦·斯佩罗 (Ellen Spero) 还没有咬指甲。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P1-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P1-S2",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "But the 47-year-old manicurist isn't cutting, filing or polishing as many nails as she'd like to, either.",
    "translation": "但这位 47 岁的美甲师也没有按照自己的意愿剪、锉或抛光指甲。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P1-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P1-S3",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Most of her clients spend $12 to $50 weekly, but last month two longtime customers suddenly stopped showing up.",
    "translation": "她的大多数客户每周花费 12 至 50 美元，但上个月，两位长期客户突然不再出现。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P1-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P1-S4",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Spero blames the softening economy.",
    "translation": "斯佩罗将此归咎于经济疲软。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P1-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P1-S5",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "\"I'm a good economic indicator,\" she says.",
    "translation": "“我是一个很好的经济指标，”她说。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P1-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P1-S6",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "\"I provide a service that people can do without when they're concerned about saving some dollars.\" So Spero is downscaling, shopping at middle-brow Dillard's department store near her suburban Cleveland home, instead of Neiman Marcus.",
    "translation": "“当人们担心节省一些钱时，我提供的服务是可以不需要的。”因此，斯佩罗正在缩小规模，在她位于克利夫兰郊区的家附近的中产阶级迪拉德百货公司购物，而不是在尼曼·马库斯 (Neiman Marcus)。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P1-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P1-S7",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "\"I don't know if other clients are going to abandon me, too,\" she says.",
    "translation": "“我不知道其他客户是否也会抛弃我，”她说。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 8,
      "ps": "P1-S8"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 8,
      "id": "P1-S8",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Even before Alan Greenspan's admission that America's red-hot economy is cooling, lots of working folks had already seen signs of the slowdown themselves.",
    "translation": "甚至在艾伦·格林斯潘承认美国炙手可热的经济正在降温之前，许多工薪阶层就已经看到了经济放缓的迹象。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 9,
      "ps": "P1-S9"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 9,
      "id": "P1-S9",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "From car dealerships to Gap outlets, sales have been lagging for months as shoppers temper their spending.",
    "translation": "从汽车经销店到 Gap 专卖店，由于购物者减少支出，销售已经滞后数月。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P2-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P2-S1",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "For retailers, who last year took in 24 percent of their revenue between Thanksgiving and Christmas, the cautious approach is coming at a crucial time.",
    "translation": "对于去年感恩节和圣诞节之间收入占总收入 24% 的零售商来说，他们在关键时刻采取了谨慎的态度。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P2-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P2-S2",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Already, experts say, holiday sales are off 7 percent from last year's pace.",
    "translation": "专家表示，假日销售已经比去年下降了 7%。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P2-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P2-S3",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "But don't sound any alarms just yet.",
    "translation": "但暂时不要拉响任何警报。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P2-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P2-S4",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Consumers seem only mildly concerned, not panicked, and many say they remain optimistic about the economy's long-term prospects even as they do some modest belt-tightening.",
    "translation": "消费者似乎只是轻度担忧，并不惊慌，许多人表示，尽管他们适度勒紧裤腰带，但他们对经济的长期前景仍然持乐观态度。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P2-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P2-S5",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Consumers say they're not in despair because, despite the dreadful headlines, their own fortunes still feel pretty good.",
    "translation": "消费者表示，他们并不绝望，因为尽管有可怕的头条新闻，但他们自己的命运仍然不错。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P2-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P2-S6",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Home prices are holding steady in most regions.",
    "translation": "大多数地区的房价保持稳定。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P2-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P2-S7",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "In Manhattan, \"there's a new gold rush happening in the $4 million to $10 million range, predominantly fed by Wall Street bonuses,\" says broker Barbara Corcoran.",
    "translation": "经纪人芭芭拉·科克伦 (Barbara Corcoran) 表示，在曼哈顿，“新一轮淘金热正在兴起，价值 400 万至 1000 万美元，主要由华尔街奖金推动”。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 8,
      "ps": "P2-S8"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 8,
      "id": "P2-S8",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "In San Francisco, prices are still rising even as frenzied overbidding quiets.",
    "translation": "在旧金山，尽管疯狂的竞价平静下来，但价格仍在上涨。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 9,
      "ps": "P2-S9"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 9,
      "id": "P2-S9",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "\"Instead of 20 to 30 offers, now maybe you only get two or three,\" says John Tealdi, a Bay Area real-estate broker.",
    "translation": "湾区房地产经纪人约翰·蒂尔迪 (John Tealdi) 表示：“现在你可能只会收到两到三个报价，而不是 20 到 30 个。”",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P3-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P3-S1",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "And most folks still feel pretty comfortable about their ability to find and keep a job.",
    "translation": "大多数人仍然对自己找到并保住工作的能力感到非常满意。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2004.js",
      "year": 2004,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:e9483a77ec893eed4ad6d499f2c0aadf895b80020720b29bbfe3ef99a8c864ac"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2004-r-t3",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P3-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P3-S2",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Many folks see silver linings to this slowdown.",
    "translation": "许多人看到了经济放缓的一线希望。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
